  m_Text: 'During Daytime, the light in this building will be brighter than outside,
    during night time it will be quite dark.

    Try entering and exiting the building
    during day and night.

    This is done by overriding the exposure while being
    in this building - this can be used to fine tune lighting in different parts
    of your scene.'
