  m_Text: "During Daytime, the volumetric effect of the sun is being enhanced in
    this small building. Set the sun direction to 20, time of day to 7 and look at
    the sun while you try to block the sunlight with the pillars on the ceiling to
    the left - you should see stronger volumetrics (\"Sun Rays\") inside the building
    than outside. \nOverriding this can be used to fine-tune interior vs. exterior
    lighting."
